<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">DateTime</h2><p class="text-gray-400 mb-4">One enormous Soli win (<code class="text-cyan-400">parse</code> &mdash; Ruby's <code class="text-cyan-400">Time.parse</code> is famously slow) against consistent losses elsewhere; every Soli DateTime operation allocates an object.</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 mb-10"><table class="w-full text-left text-sm"><thead class="bg-white/5 text-gray-300"><tr><th class="py-3 px-4">Operation</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Soli</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Ruby</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">+YJIT</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">+ZJIT</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Ratio</th></tr></thead><tbody class="text-gray-400 divide-y divide-white/10">
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">parse</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">4.598</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">162.973</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">149.908</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">153.806</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.03&times;</td></tr>
